{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And the Medanites sold him … And it came to pass at that time.</b> At that very time when Joseph was sold into Egypt because of Judah's counsel — for he said to sell him and did not say to restore him, and thus deceived his father — the fruit of Judah's deeds overtook him: he begot two sons of death and was left bereaved of both of them."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:43.642671257Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}